msgstr "``--http-port``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:184
msgid "``8080``"
msgstr "``8080``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:185
msgid "Port to bind the HTTP server."
msgstr "绑定 HTTP 服务器的端口。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:188
msgid "P2P"
msgstr "P2P"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:192
msgid ""
"These flags configure peer-to-peer KV cache sharing between MP servers "
"(see :doc:`p2p`). They are registered by ``add_p2p_args()`` on the "
"``lmcache server`` parser. P2P is enabled when ``--p2p-advertise-url`` is"
" set, which additionally requires a coordinator URL via ``--coordinator-"
"url`` (or ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``)."
msgstr ""
"这些标志配置 MP 服务器之间的点对点 KV Cache 共享（请参见 :doc:`p2p`）。它们通过 ``add_p2p_args()`` 在"
" ``lmcache server`` 解析器中注册。当设置了 ``--p2p-advertise-url`` 时，P2P 被启用，这还需要通过 "
"``--coordinator-url``（或 ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``）提供协调器 URL。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:205
msgid "``--p2p-advertise-url``"
msgstr "``--p2p-advertise-url``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:206
msgid "``\"\"`` (P2P disabled)"
msgstr "``\"\"`` (P2P 已禁用)"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:207
msgid ""
"Transfer-channel server ``host:port`` this instance advertises to peers. "
"Setting it enables P2P (also requires ``--coordinator-url``)."
msgstr "传输通道服务器 ``host:port`` 该实例向对等方宣传。设置它可以启用 P2P（还需要 ``--coordinator-url``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:209
msgid "``--p2p-listen-url``"
msgstr "``--p2p-listen-url``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:210
msgid "``\"\"``"
msgstr "``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:211
msgid ""
"Transfer-channel server ``host:port`` to bind. Defaults to ``--p2p-"
"advertise-url``."
msgstr "传输通道服务器 ``host:port`` 进行绑定。默认为 ``--p2p-advertise-url``。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:213
msgid "``--p2p-lookup-timeout``"
msgstr "``--p2p-lookup-timeout``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:214 ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:217
msgid "``30.0``"
msgstr "``30.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:215
