msgid ""
"Enable or disable lazy allocation for L1 memory. Pass ``--l1-use-lazy`` "
"to enable (default) or ``--no-l1-use-lazy`` to explicitly disable."
msgstr "启用或禁用 L1 内存的延迟分配。传递 ``--l1-use-lazy`` 以启用（默认）或 ``--no-l1-use-lazy`` 以显式禁用。"

