"``fs_native``, ``mock``, ``mooncake_store``, ``aerospike``, ``s3``, "
"``resp``, ``plugin``, ``native_plugin``, ``raw_block``, ``dax``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:407
