"``\"tcp://host1:6667,tcp://host2:6667\"``. When set, takes precedence "
"over ``lmcache.mp.host`` / ``lmcache.mp.port``; the vLLM world size must "
"be divisible by the number of servers, and each worker connects to its "
"locally-assigned server."
msgstr ""
"多服务器部署：``<transport>://<host>:<port>`` URL 的列表（或以逗号分隔的字符串），例如 "
"``\"tcp://host1:6667,tcp://host2:6667\"``。设置后，优先于 ``lmcache.mp.host`` / "
"``lmcache.mp.port``；vLLM 世界大小必须能被服务器数量整除，每个工作节点连接到其本地分配的服务器。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:520
msgid "``lmcache.mp.host``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.host``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:521
msgid "``tcp://localhost``"
msgstr "``tcp://localhost``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:522
msgid ""
"Single-server deployment: host (with ZMQ transport prefix) of the LMCache"
" MP server. Ignored when ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` is set."
msgstr ""
"单服务器部署：LMCache MP 服务器的主机（带有 ZMQ 传输前缀）。当 ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` "
"被设置时将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:525
msgid "``lmcache.mp.port``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.port``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:527
msgid ""
"Single-server deployment: port of the LMCache MP server. Must match the "
"server's ``--port``. Ignored when ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` is set."
msgstr ""
"单服务器部署：LMCache MP 服务器的端口。必须与服务器的 ``--port`` 匹配。当设置了 "
"``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` 时将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:530
msgid "``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:531
msgid "``300.0``"
msgstr "``300.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:532
msgid ""
"Timeout (seconds) for blocking message-queue requests, including the "
"initial chunk-size query and KV cache registration/unregistration. If the"
" server does not respond within this window, the connector raises "
"``ConnectionError`` on startup."
msgstr ""
"阻塞消息队列请求的超时时间（秒），包括初始块大小查询和 KV Cache 注册/注销。如果服务器在此时间窗口内未响应，连接器将在启动时引发 "
"``ConnectionError``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:536
msgid "``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.heartbeat_interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:538
msgid ""
"Interval (seconds) between periodic heartbeat pings sent from the "
"connector to the server."
msgstr "连接器向服务器发送周期性心跳 PING 的时间间隔（秒）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:540
msgid "``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode``"
msgstr "``lmcache.mp.mp_transfer_mode``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:542
msgid ""
"Routing mode for the worker -> server transfer context. One of ``auto`` "
"(CUDA -> lmcache_driven, others -> engine_driven), ``lmcache_driven`` "
"(force the IPC / SHM zero-copy handle path — LMCache server pulls data "
"via device handles), or ``engine_driven`` (force the worker-side "
"gather/scatter copy path). Overrides the ``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE`` env"
" var when set."
msgstr ""
"工作进程与服务器传输上下文的路由模式。可以是 ``auto``（CUDA -> lmcache_driven，其他 -> "
"engine_driven）、``lmcache_driven``（强制使用 IPC / SHM 零拷贝句柄路径 — LMCache "
"服务器通过设备句柄拉取数据）或 ``engine_driven``（强制使用工作进程端的收集/分散拷贝路径）。当设置时，会覆盖 "
"``LMCACHE_MP_TRANSFER_MODE`` 环境变量。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:551
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:557
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:559
msgid "``LMCACHE_LOG_LEVEL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_LOG_LEVEL``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:560
msgid ""
"Log level for LMCache (``DEBUG``, ``INFO``, ``WARNING``, ``ERROR``). Set "
"to ``DEBUG`` to see L2 store activity, prefetch results, etc."
msgstr ""
"LMCache 的日志级别（\\ ``DEBUG``\\ 、\\ ``INFO``\\ 、\\ ``WARNING``\\ 、\\ "
"``ERROR``\\ ）。设置为 ``DEBUG`` 以查看 L2 存储活动、预取结果等。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:562
msgid "``PYTHONHASHSEED``"
msgstr "``PYTHONHASHSEED``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:563
msgid ""
"Set to a fixed value for reproducible hashing across processes (relevant "
"when using ``--hash-algorithm builtin``)."
msgstr "设置为固定值以实现跨进程的可重复哈希（在使用 ``--hash-algorithm builtin`` 时相关）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:565
msgid "``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:566
msgid "Set to ``false`` to disable anonymous usage statistics (see below)."
msgstr "设置为 ``false`` 以禁用匿名使用统计（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:567
msgid "``DO_NOT_TRACK``"
msgstr "``DO_NOT_TRACK``"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:568
msgid ""
"Set to ``1`` to disable anonymous usage statistics (cross-tool "
"convention)."
msgstr "设置为 ``1`` 以禁用匿名使用统计信息（跨工具约定）。"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:572
msgid "Full Example"
msgstr "完整示例"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:608
msgid "Anonymous Usage Statistics"
msgstr "匿名使用统计"

#: ../../source/mp/configuration.rst:610
msgid ""
"The MP server reports anonymous usage statistics: a one-time "
"environment/configuration snapshot at startup and interval counters "
"(tokens retrieved/stored, bytes stored, uptime) every "
"``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL`` seconds. No prompts, keys, KV-cache "
"data, model names, or ``--instance-id`` are ever sent, and reporting can "
"never affect serving. Opt out with ``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE=false`` or "
"``DO_NOT_TRACK=1``; see :ref:`usage-stats-collection` for details."
msgstr "MP 服务器报告匿名使用统计信息：在启动时进行一次环境/配置快照，并每 ``LMCACHE_USAGE_TRACK_INTERVAL`` 秒报告一次间隔计数器（检索/存储的令牌、存储的字节、正常运行时间）。绝不会发送提示、密钥、KV Cache 数据、模型名称或 ``--instance-id``，并且报告绝不会影响服务。可以通过 ``LMCACHE_TRACK_USAGE=false`` 或 ``DO_NOT_TRACK=1`` 选择退出；有关详细信息，请参见 :ref:`usage-stats-collection`。"

